#basePath P1_Lamprey
#include "Header.leaf"

:: Start
@trigger    OnLocationChanged
// "NONE" ensures no other threads are in-progress
// global:currentPhase == 1 ensures player is in phase 1
@when       global:currentThread == "NONE", global:currentPhase == 1, location == "ResearchLab"
@cutscene
// Lock all location on map
$call SetInThreadLocks()
$call DisableMapButton()

// Mark start of thread
$set global:currentThread = "P1_Lamprey"

{@}   
       The university. What better place to learn about sea lamprey than at the very place researching them?
       You knock on the door to the lab. 
       After a moment, a young man in a fashionably tailored lab coat opens it.

{@Arjan}
       Hello? Oh, yeah. I've been waiting for you. 
       Like a psychic. 
       Haha.
       No, Renée called me to say you'd stop by. Come in. 

{@}
       You follow him. 
       A phonograph plays old-timey jazz, jumping every few beats like rocks skidding on a lake. 

{@Arjan}
       Oh. Sorry about that. It was, like, 75% off. 
       So, what can I interest you in? Chemicals? Coffee? Student loans?

{@Ana}
       I think I'll pass on those, but I do need your help. 

{@}
       You hand him the photo of the bite on the fish. //photo pops up again?

{@Arjan}
       Sea lamprey. Huh.
       They're an interesting specimen. Some might call them... 
       Fishy. Yeah, that's a good one. 

{@Ana}
       Look, I don't know a lot about sea lamprey. 
       Any information you can share with me
// TODO: Rest of thread here

// TODO: Give evidence chip
// $call GiveEvidenceChip([Evidence])

// TEMPORARY: skip to end
$goto .End


:: End
@tracked
// Unlock next locations
$call UnlockLocation(DNROffice)  // P1_NativeLamprey

// Mark end of thread
$set global:currentThread = "NONE"

// Go to Phase 1 Continue Hub
$goto P1_Hub.Continue